OL,4,CPlans unveiled for one of UK's biggest 
OL,5,Csolar farms                            
OL,6,GPlans have been unveiled to build one  
OL,7,Gof the biggest solar farms in the UK   
OL,8,Gacross a huge slice of Essex's Dengie  
OL,9,GPeninsula.                             
OL,11,FLow Carbon wants to install panels     
OL,12,Facross 4,200 acres (1,700 hectares) of 
OL,13,Fsprawling countryside between Burnham- 
OL,14,Fon-Crouch and Bradwell-on-Sea.         
OL,16,FThe developer said the site could      
OL,17,Fgenerate 1GW of power - enough to      
OL,18,Fsupply 250,000 homes, or every house   
OL,19,Fbetween Basildon and Shoeburyness.     
